                <tr id="issuerow12414588" rel="12414588" data-issuekey="CXF-2034" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2034" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2034">CXF-2034</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JMS client transport (JMSConduit) does not tear down its reply awaiting listener on Bus shutdown
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Marat Bedretdinov
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Marat Bedretdinov
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Feb/09 17:11 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Apr/09 21:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 27/Feb/09 17:22 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.11,                     2.1.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As per summary JMSConduit leaks message consumers on Bus shutdown. <br/>
<br/>
This leads to a race for the same reply message and unpredictable behaviour when more than one CXF proxy consumes messages from the same queue with matching selectors between Bus restarts. This can be easily reproduced within JUnit if two or more tests use CXF proxy with JMS transport on reading replies from the same queue.
  </td>
