                <tr id="issuerow12414603" rel="12414603" data-issuekey="CXF-2036" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2036" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2036">CXF-2036</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add option to retry a http request on socket error to http client
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Dennis Kieselhorst
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Dennis Kieselhorst
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Feb/09 18:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Jul/13 14:42 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 28/Sep/09 16:26 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.4,                     2.2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.7,                     2.2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core,                     Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">3</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      See http://www.nabble.com/Retry-on-java.net.SocketTimeoutException%3A-Read-timed-out-td21939913.html<br/>
<br/>
The client gets &#39;java.net.SocketTimeoutException: Read timed out&#39; because the remote server is currently busy or &#39;java.net.SocketException: Connection reset&#39; because of a network issue.<br/>
<br/>
A new option in the http client configuration can catch these errors for a number of times and only throws the exception, if retry was not successful.<br/>
<br/>
  &lt;http-conf:conduit name=&quot;{http://apache.org/hello_world_soap_http}SoapPort.http-conduit&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;http-conf:client RetryOnSocketError=&quot;2&quot; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/http-conf:conduit&gt;<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
