                <tr id="issuerow12414841" rel="12414841" data-issuekey="CXF-2042" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2042" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2042">CXF-2042</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Expose totalHandlingTime attribute in ResponseTimeCounterMBean to offer trendsup monitoring
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Cyrille Le Clerc
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Cyrille Le Clerc
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 15/Feb/09 22:33 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Apr/09 21:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 19/Feb/09 21:56 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.11,                     2.1.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Expose the currently internal attribute ResponseTimeCounter#totalHandlingTime in the ResponseTimeCounterMBean to offer trendsup monitoring.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks to this, monitoring tools like Hyperic HQ will be able to offer metrics per time unit like &quot;average response time for last minute/hour&quot; ( via a division of totalHandlingTime by InvocationsCount)<br/>
<br/>
Resources on Hyperic HQ&#39;s trendsup metrics monitoring : http://support.hyperic.com/display/DOC/Metric+Parameters
