                <tr id="issuerow12415133" rel="12415133" data-issuekey="CXF-2051" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2051" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2051">CXF-2051</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Exception in REST Service creates not-well-formed xml responses
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andreas Sahlbach
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andreas Sahlbach
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Feb/09 11:20 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Apr/09 21:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Mar/09 17:59 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2,                     2.1.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAXB Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve got this with SOAP and REST services using JAXB Databinding. In case of errors during the databinding phase, I get not well-formed xml like this:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot; standalone=&quot;yes&quot;?&gt;&lt;Company&gt;&lt;addresses&gt;&lt;address1Ntl&gt;street&lt;/address1Ntl&gt;&lt;cityNtl&gt;city&lt;/cityNtl&gt;&lt;countryISO&gt;276&lt;/countryISO&gt;&lt;type&gt;Extern&lt;/type&gt;&lt;zipCity&gt;69250&lt;/zipCity&gt;&lt;/addresses&gt;&lt;ns1:XMLFault xmlns:ns1=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/bindings/xformat&quot;&gt;&lt;ns1:faultstring xmlns:ns1=&quot;http://cxf.apache.org/bindings/xformat&quot;&gt;org.hibernate.LazyInitializationException: failed to lazily initialize a collection of role: de.volkswagen.ums.persistence.data.PersistentOrganization.displaynames, no session or session was closed&lt;/ns1:faultstring&gt;&lt;/ns1:XMLFault&gt;<br/>
<br/>
So the already created beginning of the response is not replaced but appended by the fault, creating a not usable response.
  </td>
