                                            <td class="description">      When JavaMethod gets created for an operation from the WSDL suffixed with &quot;Async&quot;, OperationProcessor:181 evaluates to true and line 182 throws an NPE because the method object&#39;s JavaReturn object was never populated with properties (method.getReturn().getClassName() == null).  I don&#39;t see method&#39;s JavaReturn object ever getting set in the execution stack.
