                <tr id="issuerow12415491" rel="12415491" data-issuekey="CXF-2062" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2062" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2062">CXF-2062</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                MTOM content-type header missing required &quot;type&quot; parameter
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Feb/09 17:40 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Apr/09 21:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Feb/09 17:58 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.11,                     2.1.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      http://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2387 says that the &quot;Type&quot; parameter is required.   We&#39;re only outputting it for xop, not for other mime things. <br/>
<br/>
Also, the charset is stuck on the multipart/related content-type header when it shouldn&#39;t be.  (just needed in the individual part headers)
  </td>
