                <tr id="issuerow12415829" rel="12415829" data-issuekey="CXF-2077" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2077" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2077">CXF-2077</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                When using wsdl2java with the -db xmlbeans flag, the generated build.xml doesn&#39;t work OOTB
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Willem Jiang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Dave Stanley
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Dave Stanley
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Feb/09 22:34 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Apr/09 21:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Mar/09 04:07 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2,                     2.0.11,                     2.1.5            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      2.1.x, trunk
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When using wsdl2java with the -db xmlbeans flag, the generated build.xml is missing a classpath entry for xmlbeans schema files.<br/>
<br/>
To reproduce, in a clean directory run:<br/>
<br/>
&gt;wsdl2java -db xmlbeans -all &lt;wsdl&gt;<br/>
<br/>
I had to add the following to my build.xml to pick up the generated schema files:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;property name=&quot;home.dir&quot; location =&quot;.&quot;/&gt;<br/>
....<br/>
&lt;path id=&quot;cxf.classpath&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;pathelement location=&quot;${build.classes.dir}&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;pathelement location=&quot;${cxf-manifest.jar.file}&quot;/&gt;<br/>
	&lt;pathelement location=&quot;${home.dir}&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/path&gt;  <br/>

  </td>
