                                            <td class="description">      For example in the manifest of cxf-bundle-jaxrs-2.2:<br/>
<br/>
Import-Package: .......<br/>
org.apache.cxf..svn.text-base;version=&quot;2.2.0.SNAPSHOT&quot;,<br/>
org.apache.cxf.aegis;version=&quot;2.2.0.SNAPSHOT&quot;,<br/>
org.apache.cxf. aegis.databinding;version=&quot;2.2.0.SNAPSHOT&quot;,<br/>
org.apache.cxf.aegis.databinding..svn.prop-base;.......<br/>
<br/>
The ..svn something isn&#39;t right.
