                <tr id="issuerow12421851" rel="12421851" data-issuekey="CXF-2147" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2147" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2147">CXF-2147</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
            <span class="parentIssue">CXF-1243</span>
                wsdl2java does not generate @XmlList with doc/lit wsdl
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Sub-task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Apr/09 09:37 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Apr/09 21:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Apr/09 21:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.5,                     2.2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is related to https://jira.jboss.org/jira/browse/JBWS-2591 .<br/>
Basically, when running the tools (wsdl -&gt; java) the @XmlList annotation is added to the SEI only for rpc/lit wsdl as there&#39;s a check for !part.isElement().<br/>
This prevents doc/lit bare methods from having the @XmlList annotation for both return type and parameters in the SEI.<br/>
<br/>
The use case that revealed this is the com/sun/ts/tests/jaxws/ee/w2j/document/literal/marshalltest/Client.java#MarshallListTypesTest_from_wsappclient_reverse test in the JAXWS module of JavaEE CTS TCK. It&#39;s also reproduced in a minimal testcase linked at https://jira.jboss.org/jira/browse/JBWS-2591 .<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
