                <tr id="issuerow12421879" rel="12421879" data-issuekey="CXF-2148" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2148" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2148">CXF-2148</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
            <span class="parentIssue">CXF-1243</span>
                wsdl2java does not generate @XmlJavaTypeAdapter in SEI
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Sub-task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Apr/09 14:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Apr/09 21:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Apr/09 21:02 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.5,                     2.2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      CXF seems not to add the javax.xml.bind.annotation.adapters.XmlJavaTypeAdapter annotation when running the wsdl2java tool against a wsdl with a message like this:<br/>
&lt;message name=&quot;inoutSimpleTypesResponse&quot;&gt;<br/>
    ...<br/>
    &lt;part name=&quot;varHexBinary&quot; type=&quot;xsd:hexBinary&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/message&gt;<br/>
<br/>
This should cause the corresponding param in one of the SEI method to have a @XmlJavaTypeAdapter(HexBinaryAdapter.class) .
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
