                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
If a type has an XmlRootElement annotation on it and it&#39;s used for a method param/return value, with RPC/Lit, the parts in the generated wsdl are ending up as element parts intstead of type parts.  That is not correct according to ws-bp rules.<br/>
