                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Code that attempts to set http headers for the client, such as:<br/>
<br/>
            Map&lt;String, List&lt;String&gt;&gt; headers <br/>
                = CastUtils.cast((Map)bp.getRequestContext().get(&quot;javax.xml.ws.http.request.headers&quot;));<br/>
<br/>
            if (headers == null) {<br/>
                headers = new HashMap&lt;String, List&lt;String&gt;&gt;();<br/>
                bp.getRequestContext().put(&quot;javax.xml.ws.http.request.headers&quot;, headers);<br/>
            }<br/>
<br/>
            List&lt;String&gt; cookies = Arrays.asList(new String[] {&quot;a=a&quot;, &quot;b=b&quot;});<br/>
            headers.put(&quot;Cookie&quot;, cookies);<br/>
<br/>
is not working with 2.2.   Worked fine with 2.1.3.<br/>

  </td>
