                <tr id="issuerow12423474" rel="12423474" data-issuekey="CXF-2185" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2185" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2185">CXF-2185</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
            <span class="parentIssue">CXF-1243</span>
                Handler protocol match fails when multiple protocols are specified
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Sub-task</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Apr/09 13:27 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 04/Jun/09 21:32 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/May/09 14:42 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.2,                     2.1.6            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The boolean protocolMatches(Element el, String id) method in AnnotationHandlerChainBuilder does not support multiple protocols specified in the &lt;protocol-bindings&gt; element of a handler chain descriptor.<br/>
For instance one could have:<br/>
&lt;handler-chain&gt;<br/>
    &lt;protocol-bindings&gt;##SOAP11_HTTP ##SOAP12_HTTP&lt;/protocol-bindings&gt;<br/>
		&lt;handler&gt;<br/>
			&lt;handler-name&gt; SOAPServerHandler &lt;/handler-name&gt;<br/>
			&lt;handler-class&gt; org.jboss.test.ws.jaxws.handlerscope.SOAPServerHandler &lt;/handler-class&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/handler&gt;<br/>
&lt;/handler-chain&gt;<br/>
which is valid considering protocol-bindings is basically an xsd:list.
  </td>
