                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In the writeHeaders method of AttachmentSerializer the attachment id is being incorrectly set. When the attachment id is substring&#39;d it is removing the last 2 characters when it should only be removing the last character. This generates an attachment id that does not deserialize properly.<br/>
<br/>
I have attached a patch that fixes this issue.
