                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As mentioned on the Project Wink proposal thread in the incubator, we pulled the JAX-RS related code in CXF and used it to build up a small runtime.  We&#39;d like to share those changes with you so you can see what we&#39;ve done.  This doesn&#39;t mean we expect you to incorporate the changes, but we did want to provide them in case you are interested.  <br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll attach a jar that includes the classes that we pull and the changes therein.  I can also create a diff of the classes against your latest tree if you&#39;d like.  <br/>
<br/>
The code here won&#39;t compile in your environment since it has references to some internal classes.
