     [java] org.apache.cxf.tools.common.ToolException: Thrown by JAXB : &quot;http://localhost:8080/MyService/TestService?wsdl&quot; is not a part of this compilation. Is this a mistake for &quot;http://localhost:8080/MyService/TestService?wsdl#types3&quot;? at line 5 column 95 of schema file:/C:/workspace/testclient/build/java-bindings.xml<br/>
