                                            <td class="description">      I created a web service using WSDL2Java approach. I was able to deploy the service to the Tomcat or JBoss servers no exception. However, when send a request to the service using soapUI. I got &#39;No service was found&#39; on the browser and a warning on the output:<br/>
   Can&#39;t find the request for http://localhost:8080/JAXBDataService/services/RetrieveService&#39;s Observer<br/>
<br/>
I am attaching related info here:<br/>
<br/>
