                <tr id="issuerow12426341" rel="12426341" data-issuekey="CXF-2240" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2240" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2240">CXF-2240</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                add ibmjdk profile for cxf-codegen-plugin
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/May/09 11:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 03/Aug/09 20:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 27/May/09 02:16 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.11,                     2.1.5,                     2.2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      cxf-codegen-plugin need xercesImp dependency with IBM JDK, so if other project use cxf-code-plugin with IBM JDK, need add IBM JDK pofile to change default cxf-codegen-plugin dependency, like what already done in <br/>
https://issues.apache.org/activemq/browse/CAMEL-939<br/>
https://issues.apache.org/activemq/browse/SMX4-149<br/>
We can add ibm jdk profile in cxf-codegen-plugin pom to avoid this<br/>
like add <br/>
+    &lt;profiles&gt;<br/>
+        &lt;profile&gt;<br/>
+            &lt;id&gt;ibmjdk&lt;/id&gt;<br/>
+            &lt;activation&gt;<br/>
+                &lt;property&gt;<br/>
+                    &lt;name&gt;java.vendor&lt;/name&gt;<br/>
+                    &lt;value&gt;IBM Corporation&lt;/value&gt;<br/>
+                &lt;/property&gt;<br/>
+            &lt;/activation&gt;<br/>
+            &lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
+                &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
+                    &lt;groupId&gt;xerces&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
+                    &lt;artifactId&gt;xercesImpl&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
+                    &lt;version&gt;2.8.1&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
+                &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
+            &lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
+        &lt;/profile&gt;<br/>
+    &lt;/profiles&gt;<br/>

  </td>
