                <tr id="issuerow12426357" rel="12426357" data-issuekey="CXF-2241" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2241" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2241">CXF-2241</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                wsdl2java produces code with compile error, trying to instantiate abstract class
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Christopher Marshall
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Christopher Marshall
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/May/09 15:02 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 03/Aug/09 20:06 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/Jun/09 19:50 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.6,                     2.2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Linux, Eclipse 3.5RC1
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      For wsdl that includes abstract complex types as:<br/>
<br/>
      &lt;complexType name=&quot;ReportJob&quot; abstract=&quot;true&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;sequence&gt;<br/>
          &lt;element name=&quot;clientEmails&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; maxOccurs=&quot;unbounded&quot; type=&quot;xsd:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
          &lt;element name=&quot;crossClient&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; type=&quot;xsd:boolean&quot;/&gt;<br/>
          &lt;element name=&quot;endDay&quot; type=&quot;xsd:date&quot;/&gt;<br/>
          &lt;element name=&quot;id&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; type=&quot;xsd:long&quot;/&gt;<br/>
          &lt;element name=&quot;name&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; type=&quot;xsd:string&quot;/&gt;<br/>
          &lt;element name=&quot;startDay&quot; type=&quot;xsd:date&quot;/&gt;<br/>
          &lt;element name=&quot;status&quot; minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; type=&quot;impl:ReportJobStatus&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/sequence&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/complexType&gt;<br/>
<br/>
an abstract class will be generated and the sample client will include code that tries to instantiate this class which of course causes a complile error.<br/>
<br/>
The sample above is from the Google AdWords API and the full WSDL can be downloaded from:<br/>
<br/>
https://adwords.google.com/api/adwords/v13/ReportService?wsdl<br/>
<br/>
Chris Marshall
  </td>
