                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In the doSignBeforeEncrypt method there is <br/>
<br/>
catch (Exception e) {<br/>
   e.printStackTrace();<br/>
  //REVISIT<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
 I reckon something like this would be more appropriate.<br/>
catch (Exception e) {<br/>
            String reason = e.getMessage();<br/>
            LOG.log(Level.WARNING, &quot;Sign before encryption failed due to : &quot; + reason);<br/>
            throw new Fault(e);<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll be submitting a patch for this soon<br/>

