                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
When an operation can otherwise be unwrapped, -autoNameResolution flag is not working to rename parts with different types.     <br/>
<br/>
Two issues:<br/>
1) The validator is not checking the flag so validation always fails.<br/>
<br/>
2) If 1 is fixed, the part is marked INOUT, not OUT.
