</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In org.apache.cxf.transport.http.AbstractHttpDestination.setupMessage() method only mime-type should be set on the message.<br/>
For example:<br/>
If the content-type header on a request is :<br/>
<br/>
application/xml;charset=utf-8<br/>
<br/>
an IllegalArgumentException is thrown in org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.utils.JAXRSUtils.findTargetMethod() as it expects only mime type.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
