                <tr id="issuerow12428264" rel="12428264" data-issuekey="CXF-2302" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2302" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2302">CXF-2302</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                HTTP continuations are not working correctly if keep-alives are on
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Jun/09 15:30 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 03/Aug/09 20:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Jun/09 17:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.11,                     2.1.5,                     2.2.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.12,                     2.1.6,                     2.2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Transports            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
The HTTP continuations are using the jetty continuation isNew method to see if it&#39;s &quot;new&quot;.  However, that method is really not named correctly as it&#39;s &quot;new per connection&quot; not &quot;per request&quot;.  Thus, with keep alives, the continuation is reused and CXF state gets confused.
  </td>
