                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi<br/>
<br/>
Is WADL auto creation feature available in CXF? I am able to see WSDL for SOAP web services when I do ?wsdl in browser url. Is there any such support for REST services? This is feature helped me to test SOAP web services in soapUI and other tools. I would like to know as to how to generate WADL in CXF? Thanks in advance<br/>
<br/>
Karuna Kumar
