</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Invalid signature of cxf.apache.org/javadoc/latest/org/apache/cxf/ws/addressing/AddressingProperties.html#setTo
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            johan Eltes
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            johan Eltes
    </td>
