                                            <td class="description">      Current signature:<br/>
http://cxf.apache.org/javadoc/latest/org/apache/cxf/ws/addressing/AddressingProperties.html#setTo(org.apache.cxf.ws.addressing.EndpointReferenceType)<br/>
<br/>
Should be:<br/>
http://cxf.apache.org/javadoc/latest/org/apache/cxf/ws/addressing/AddressingProperties.html#setTo(org.apache.cxf.ws.addressing.AttributedURIType)<br/>
<br/>
Without this change, it is not possible to set was:To to a value that is permitted by AttributedURIType but nit permitted by he more restrictive EndpointReferenceType.
  </td>
