</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      tried on both Ubuntu  9.04 and CentOS 5.3,<br/>
java 6<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      web service client de-serializes   org.w3c.dom.Document  with extra &lt;return&gt; tags. <br/>
i.e. result of getExampleDocument() should be &lt;node&gt;test&lt;/node&gt; but the client gets  &lt;return&gt;&lt;node&gt;test&lt;/node&gt;&lt;return&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The message that server sends is <br/>
<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;soap:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;ns1:getExampleDocumentResponse xmlns:ns1=&quot;http://cxftest.org/&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;return&gt;&lt;node&gt;test&lt;/node&gt;&lt;/return&gt;&lt;/ns1:getExampleDocumentResponse&gt;<br/>
&lt;/soap:Body&gt;&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;
  </td>
