                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This works in Jersey, but not in CXF:<br/>
<br/>
class ........ {<br/>
<br/>
@Context<br/>
private UriInfo context;<br/>
<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
The alternative, works on both CXF and Jersey:<br/>
<br/>
class ...... {<br/>
<br/>
@GET<br/>
public void something(@Context UriInfo context) {<br/>
  ...<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
}
