                <tr id="issuerow12430204" rel="12430204" data-issuekey="CXF-2338" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2338" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2338">CXF-2338</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Service created from WSDL doesn&#39;t deserialize correctly
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Anders Storsveen
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Anders Storsveen
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/Jul/09 13:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 04/Aug/09 11:54 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Jul/09 18:12 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAXB Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Darwin fou162.telenor.ntnu.no 9.7.0 Darwin Kernel Version 9.7.0: Tue Mar 31 22:52:17 PDT 2009; root:xnu-1228.12.14~1/RELEASE_I386 i386<br/>
fou162:lib wakko$ mvn --version<br/>
Maven version: 2.0.9<br/>
Java version: 1.6.0_13<br/>
OS name: &quot;mac os x&quot; version: &quot;10.5.7&quot; arch: &quot;x86_64&quot; Family: &quot;mac&quot;<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m trying to create a web service from a WSDL file and then run it embedded in my java application. I&#39;m using maven to generate the classes and then create my own Impl and start it with Endpoint.publish(). This seems to work fine, however not all deserialize correctly. The method in question, takes two parameters, one String and one complex SmsMessage class. When I invoke the method the SOAP is fine (and there exists other services built on this wsdl that works) however the String in the method is set correctly, while the complex class is empty. <br/>
<br/>
The wsdl file in question: http://px.pats.no/px/services/SmsNotification?WSDL<br/>
A web-based client that can be used to invoke the service: http://px.pats.no/px/4_short_messaging/index_notification_SMS.html<br/>
<br/>
From my pom.xml file:<br/>
<br/>
