                <tr id="issuerow12430509" rel="12430509" data-issuekey="CXF-2341" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2341" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2341">CXF-2341</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                common/common test failures with ibm jdk due to excluded jaxp-api dependency 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Peter Jones
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Peter Jones
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Peter Jones
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 15/Jul/09 15:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 03/Aug/09 20:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Jul/09 16:08 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      ibm jdk 5 on linux and aix
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
Getting class not found exceptions for class javax.xml.transform.stax.StAXResult when running StaxUtilsTest, W3CDOMStreamReaderTest and XMLUtilsTest with the ibm jdk.  Stack traces look something like this:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
java.lang.NoClassDefFoundError: javax.xml.transform.stax.StAXResult<br/>
at com.sun.org.apache.xalan.internal.xsltc.trax.TransformerImpl.getOutputHandler(TransformerImpl.java:416)<br/>
at com.sun.org.apache.xalan.internal.xsltc.trax.TransformerImpl.transform(TransformerImpl.java:334)<br/>
at org.apache.cxf.helpers.XMLUtils.writeTo(XMLUtils.java:191)<br/>
at org.apache.cxf.helpers.XMLUtils.writeTo(XMLUtils.java:169)<br/>
at org.apache.cxf.helpers.XMLUtils.writeTo(XMLUtils.java:161)<br/>
at org.apache.cxf.helpers.XMLUtils.writeTo(XMLUtils.java:155)<br/>
at org.apache.cxf.helpers.XMLUtils.toString(XMLUtils.java:222)<br/>
at org.apache.cxf.staxutils.StaxUtilsTest.cycleString(StaxUtilsTest.java:207)<br/>
at org.apache.cxf.staxutils.StaxUtilsTest.testEmptyNamespace(StaxUtilsTest.java:186)<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
We add a jaxp-ri dependency specifically for the ibm jdk, in a couple of places where it&#39;s needed but it seems in the parent/pom.xml we exclude jaxp-api:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
            &lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
                &lt;groupId&gt;com.sun.xml.parsers&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                &lt;artifactId&gt;jaxp-ri&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                &lt;version&gt;1.4.2&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
                &lt;exclusions&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;exclusion&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;groupId&gt;javax.xml.parsers&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;artifactId&gt;jaxp-api&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/exclusion&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/exclusions&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
Is there a reason we still need to exclude jaxp-api?  If it&#39;s not excluded, the failing tests will pass.
  </td>
