  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Four of the tests in JAXRSClientServerSpringBookTest check for a specific string contained in expected_add_book_aegis.txt:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;ns1:Book xmlns:ns1=&quot;http://jaxrs.systest.cxf.apache.org&quot; xmlns:ns2=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot; ns2:type=&quot;ns1:Book&quot;&gt;&lt;ns1:id&gt;124&lt;/ns1:id&gt;&lt;ns1:name&gt;CXF in Action - 2&lt;/ns1:name&gt;&lt;/ns1:Book&gt;<br/>
<br/>
however, with the ibm jdk 5, the order of the id and name elements are switched in the actual result.  I&#39;ll update the test to check for a different expected result when using the ibm jdk, unless of course someone suggests that the ordering should be of any significance here.
  </td>
