                <tr id="issuerow12431190" rel="12431190" data-issuekey="CXF-2354" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2354" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2354">CXF-2354</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WSDLException thrown for NO Subject alternative DNS name matching when the server names do actually match
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Conor Buescher
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Conor Buescher
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Jul/09 22:20 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 04/Dec/09 22:38 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Oct/09 21:10 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        Invalid            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Ubuntu 8.10 32bit OS, Java 1.6.10, CXF 2.2.2, Ant 1.7.1
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am working on building a java based web services client for an already deployed .Net based web service built using WCF.  I am unable to run wsdl2java on the remote wsdl and have downloaded all of the associated wsdl files to my machine and I can then run wsdl2java using the following ant build.xml file:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot;?&gt; <br/>
&lt;project name=&quot;cxf wsdl2java&quot; default=&quot;cxfWSDL2Java&quot; basedir=&quot;.&quot;&gt;    <br/>
   &lt;property name=&quot;cxf.home&quot; location =&quot;/home/conorb/devTools/apache-cxf-2.2.2&quot;/&gt; <br/>
 <br/>
   &lt;path id=&quot;cxf.classpath&quot;&gt; <br/>
      &lt;fileset dir=&quot;${cxf.home}/lib&quot;&gt; <br/>
         &lt;include name=&quot;*.jar&quot;/&gt; <br/>
	 &lt;include name=&quot;*.xml&quot;/&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/fileset&gt; <br/>
   &lt;/path&gt; <br/>
       <br/>
   &lt;target name=&quot;cxfWSDL2Java&quot;&gt; <br/>
      &lt;java classname=&quot;org.apache.cxf.tools.wsdlto.WSDLToJava&quot; fork=&quot;true&quot;&gt; <br/>
	&lt;arg value=&quot;-ant&quot;/&gt; <br/>
	&lt;arg value=&quot;-client&quot;/&gt;<br/>
	&lt;arg value=&quot;-verbose&quot;/&gt; <br/>
	&lt;arg value=&quot;-sn&quot;/&gt;  <br/>
	&lt;arg value=&quot;CustomerService&quot;/&gt; <br/>
	&lt;arg value=&quot;-d&quot;/&gt; <br/>
	&lt;arg value=&quot;ispe-client&quot;/&gt; <br/>
	&lt;arg value=&quot;/home/conorb/Documents/groovy/CustomerService.wsdl&quot;/&gt; <br/>
	&lt;classpath&gt; <br/>
		&lt;path refid=&quot;cxf.classpath&quot;/&gt; <br/>
	&lt;/classpath&gt; <br/>
      &lt;/java&gt; <br/>
   &lt;/target&gt; <br/>
&lt;/project&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Once that works I can edit the created files to point to the wsdl url, the external url is here: https://g4w0209.americas.hpqcorp.net/HPISWeb/ISASCustomerWebService/CustomerService.svc?wsdl - and then make changes to the client class for testing the service.<br/>
<br/>
Additionally I download the SSL certificate into my java keystore using the following command: sudo keytool -import -trustcacerts -keystore  /usr/lib/jvm/java-6-sun-1.6.0.10/jre/lib/security/cacerts -storepass changeit -alias g4w0217 -file /home/conorb/Documents/groovy/g4w0217.cert.pem <br/>
<br/>
When I run ant ICustomerServiceClient on my modified java code I receive the following error:<br/>
<br/>
conorb@conorb-desktop:~/Documents/groovy/ispe-client$ ant ICustomerServiceClient<br/>
Buildfile: build.xml<br/>
<br/>
compile:<br/>
<br/>
