                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      1) The in fault interceptor chain is not being called on the clients<br/>
2) If a client throws an exception on the outbound interceptor chain the chain stops but later the client still invokes on the server.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll be submitting a potential patch fix soon.
