                <tr id="issuerow12431937" rel="12431937" data-issuekey="CXF-2374" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2374" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2374">CXF-2374</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Handle possible number format exception when reading primitive param
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jorge L. Williams
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jorge L. Williams
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Jul/09 21:07 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 12/Oct/09 20:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Aug/09 20:01 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      We ran into this issue in JAX-RS:   A request to something like /path/<br/>
to/{id} where {id} is expected to be an integer would throw a<br/>
NumberFormatException in the case where we send something other than<br/>
an integer (/path/to/bla, for example).  The NumberFormatException<br/>
didn&#39;t find its way to our ExceptionMapper and resulted in an XMLFault<br/>
being serialized which is wrong.<br/>
<br/>
The attached patch fixes things for us.  We simply capture the NFE and<br/>
resend it as a WebApplicationException -- we send a  404 when we&#39;re<br/>
dealing with path params and 400 otherwise.  The patch is against the<br/>
current trunk but honestly we&#39;ve really only tested against 2.2.2 --<br/>
since that&#39;s what we&#39;re using :-)
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310060"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312322"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312520"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312323"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312521">    8 years, 3 days ago

                        </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312320"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310420">      113800
  </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312321"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312120">
</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312121"><span class="sla-agent-restricted">Restricted to agents</span>
</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312328"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312329"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312923"></td>
