                                            <td class="description">      The CXF maven plugin &quot;cxf-codegen-plugin&quot;  fails to read WSDL files from a jar file deployed  on a maven repository whic was declared as a dependency by the webservice client project <br/>
<br/>
While setting the following for wsdlOption<br/>
                &lt;wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
                  &lt;wsdl&gt;classpath:/myfolder/myown.wsdl&lt;/wsdl&gt;<br/>
                 ---<br/>
