                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I need to write an interceptor that store soap messages that cause a fault. <br/>
<br/>
A way to do it is to implement the handleFault method in an interceptor that extends LoggingInInterceptor. <br/>
<br/>
In the handleFault method I need to access to the LoggingMessage which was created by the handleMessage method.<br/>
<br/>
To achieve this, I&#39;ve just added the LoggingMessage in the content of the Message :<br/>
<br/>
message.setContent(LoggingMessage.class, buffer);<br/>
<br/>
Patch attached.
  </td>
