                <tr id="issuerow12432663" rel="12432663" data-issuekey="CXF-2384" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2384" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2384">CXF-2384</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                SOAPFaultExcption thrown instead of a WebServiceException
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Niek Palm
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Niek Palm
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Aug/09 08:49 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Oct/10 14:52 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Oct/10 17:21 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      jdk1.6, ubuntu 9.10
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When the connection of the webservice is lost we get a SoapFaultException instead of of a WebServiceException. We use the dispachter in the following way:<br/>
		<br/>
<br/>
	Service service = Service.create(SERVICE_NAME);<br/>
	service.addPort(PORT_NAME, SOAPBinding.SOAP11HTTP_BINDING, url.toString());<br/>
	Dispatch&lt;SOAPMessage&gt; dispatch = service.createDispatch(PORT_NAME, SOAPMessage.class, Service.Mode.MESSAGE);<br/>
	SOAPMessage response = dispatch.invoke(request);<br/>
<br/>
Looking in the API  (http://java.sun.com/javase/6/docs/api/javax/xml/ws/Dispatch.html#invoke(T)), there is specified that any communication problem will cause in a WebServiceException. To our point of view this is a bug in cxf.
  </td>
