                <tr id="issuerow12433309" rel="12433309" data-issuekey="CXF-2395" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2395" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2395">CXF-2395</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                The wsdl provided does not match the service.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Blocker
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Knut Ivar Skogland
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Knut Ivar Skogland
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Aug/09 08:16 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 04/Jan/10 08:36 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/Aug/09 06:40 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Java 1.5.0_09, Tomcat 5.5.26
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve made a small testproject with CXF using XMLBeans and contract first (XSD). <br/>
<br/>
The project consist of two services; SumFacade and AppendFacade, but when I ask for WSDL, only the wsdl for SumFacade appears (regardless of url).<br/>
<br/>
SymTestFacade: <br/>
http://localhost:8080/cxftest/published/ws/test/SumTestFacade?wsdl<br/>
AppendTestFacade:<br/>
http://localhost:8080/cxftest/published/ws/test/AppendTestFacade?wsdl<br/>
<br/>
I even tried making the SoapRequest myself ... ;<br/>
<br/>
&lt;soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot; xmlns:app=&quot;http://cxftest.com/webservicetest/ws/test/append&quot; xmlns:typ=&quot;http://cxftest.com/webservicetest/ws/test/append/types&quot;&gt;<br/>
   &lt;soapenv:Header&gt;<br/>
      &lt;app:userCredentials&gt;<br/>
         &lt;app:userName&gt;myuser&lt;/app:userName&gt;<br/>
         &lt;app:password&gt;mypass&lt;/app:password&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/app:userCredentials&gt;<br/>
   &lt;/soapenv:Header&gt;<br/>
