  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
I am facing an issue where the outbound SOAP request from the CXF client seems to be missing the SOAP body.<br/>
I enabled logging and below is how the log looks that show the Outbound/Inbound SOAP request/response.<br/>
<br/>
The deployed web service has 2 webmethods &quot;getFirstName()&quot; and &quot;getLastName()&quot; and calls to both of these returns the result from the getFirstName() method, see below log:<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
