<br/>
The request is missing the soap:Body information:<br/>
Payload: &lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/&quot;&gt;&lt;soap:Body /&gt;&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
<br/>
I am attaching the WDSL , CXF client and also the deployed web service class for reference.<br/>
<br/>
