                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      HttpsToken RequireClientCertificate=true has several issues:<br/>
<br/>
1) On Java 5 - it&#39;s not processed at all.  The runtime is always assume RequireClientCertificate=false<br/>
<br/>
2) On Java 6 - it&#39;s trying to check if the Peer certs are available before the connection is made and an exception is being raised. <br/>
<br/>
