                <tr id="issuerow12434918" rel="12434918" data-issuekey="CXF-2422" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2422" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2422">CXF-2422</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                DataBindingProvider should be &lt;T&gt;
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Sep/09 16:49 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Feb/10 19:02 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/Dec/09 21:36 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.6            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Defining DataBindingProvider to be ungeneric and implementing the &lt;Object&gt; forms of the interfaces is just wrong and defeats the generic nature of the underlying interfaces. It should be DataBindingProvider&lt;T&gt;, reading and writing T&#39;s.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve fixed this for Aegis and I&#39;m going to commit that soon, but I leave this for someone else.<br/>

  </td>
