</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2455" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2455">CXF-2455</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Unable to disable schema validation in 2.2.4-SNAPSHOT
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Arik Gorelik
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Arik Gorelik
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Sep/09 21:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 12/Oct/09 20:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/Oct/09 02:57 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hello,<br/>
<br/>
It seems I am unable to disable schema validation CXF 2.2.4-SNAPSHOT as it is enabled by default?      <br/>
<br/>
&lt;jaxws:endpoint<br/>
            id=&quot;testService&quot;<br/>
            implementor=&quot;testServiceImpl&quot;<br/>
            wsdlLocation=&quot;wsdl/v29/testService.wsdl&quot;<br/>
            address=&quot;/v29/testService&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;jaxws:properties&gt;<br/>
                &lt;entry key=&quot;schema-validation-enabled&quot; value=&quot;false&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/jaxws:properties&gt;<br/>
            &lt;jaxws:inInterceptors&gt;<br/>
                &lt;ref bean=&quot;testInterceptor&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/jaxws:inInterceptors&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/jaxws:endpoint&gt;<br/>
<br/>
This works in 2.2.3 as I am able to disable schema validation to perform custom checks myself. However, in the latest 2.2.4-SNAPSHOT, I am not longer able to disable the schema validation. Is there another way to do this without touching the Endpoint Service Interface/Class? I am using a WSDL first approach to develop my services.<br/>
<br/>
Best Regards,<br/>
Arik.
