                <tr id="issuerow12437415" rel="12437415" data-issuekey="CXF-2460" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2460" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2460">CXF-2460</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Allow configuration of JaxWsClientFactoryBean during port creation
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Oct/09 16:43 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 19/Mar/10 16:35 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 06/Oct/09 18:06 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.4,                     2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Configuration,                     JAX-WS Runtime,                     Service Model            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-2723                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Many of the model factory bean allow for configuration using a Configurer instance plugged into the Bus as extension. This is actually a really cool thing. During the port creation process (client side, org.apache.cxf.jaxws.ServiceImpl class), it&#39;s currently possible to configure the JaxWsProxyFactoryBean, the Service and the JaxWsEndpointImpl. It would be good to allow for configuration of the JaxWsClientFactoryBean too before it&#39;s used to create the Service.<br/>
This basically means adding just another hook to the Configurer installed in the bus. 
  </td>
