                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have my own SELoggingInterceptor. But it is same as LoggingInInterceptor code with no difference.<br/>
<br/>
I see that when message is larger than 64kb i.e. when CachedOutputStream write to temp file, this interceptor is called twice.<br/>
First time, I process the message and second time I get Stream is closed Exception when I try to copy Message,content (InputStream) to CachedOutputStream.<br/>
<br/>
I tried printing the interceptor chain and I see my interceptor only once.<br/>
It happens only with larger messages with CXF 2.1.5.
  </td>
