                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When generating classes from WSDL the path of wsdlLocation etc. in the service-class is always generated absolute e.g. wsdlLocation = &quot;file:/C:/Projekte/Intern/...<br/>
<br/>
the configuration in the pom.xml is like this:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
							&lt;sourceRoot&gt;./target/generated-sources/jaxws<br/>
							&lt;/sourceRoot&gt;<br/>
							&lt;wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
								&lt;wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
									&lt;wsdl&gt;<br/>
										./src/main/resources/wsdl/My.wsdl<br/>
									&lt;/wsdl&gt;<br/>
									&lt;extraargs&gt;<br/>
										&lt;extraarg&gt;-wsdlLocation&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
										&lt;extraarg&gt;./src/main/resources/wsdl/My.wsdl&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
										&lt;extraarg&gt;-verbose&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
									&lt;/extraargs&gt;<br/>
								&lt;/wsdlOption&gt;<br/>
							&lt;/wsdlOptions&gt;<br/>
						&lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>

  </td>
