                <tr id="issuerow12440427" rel="12440427" data-issuekey="CXF-2531" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2531" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2531">CXF-2531</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Wrong &quot;transport&quot; attribute in soap12:binding
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Nov/09 17:18 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Mar/10 02:59 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 16/Feb/10 18:31 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Soap Binding,                     Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-2658                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When deploying an endpoint having @BindingType(SOAP12HTTP_BINDING), in the generated wsdl we get a wsdl like this:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;wsdl:binding name=&quot;SOAPEndpointServiceSoapBinding&quot; type=&quot;tns:SOAPEndpoint&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;soap12:binding style=&quot;rpc&quot; transport=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2003/05/soap/bindings/HTTP/&quot;/&gt;<br/>
  &lt;wsdl:operation name=&quot;namespace&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;soap12:operation soapAction=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;rpc&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;wsdl:input name=&quot;namespace&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;soap12:body namespace=&quot;http://org.jboss.ws/jaxws/binding&quot; use=&quot;literal&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/wsdl:input&gt;<br/>
    &lt;wsdl:output name=&quot;namespaceResponse&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;soap12:body namespace=&quot;http://org.jboss.ws/jaxws/binding&quot; use=&quot;literal&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/wsdl:output&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/wsdl:operation&gt;<br/>
&lt;/wsdl:binding&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The problem is that transport=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2003/05/soap/bindings/HTTP/&quot; while it should be trasport=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/http&quot; as specified in <br/>
http://www.w3.org/Submission/2006/SUBM-wsdl11soap12-20060405/#binding-element<br/>
http://www.ws-i.org/Profiles/BasicProfile-2_0(WGD).html#HTTP_Transport
  </td>
