                                            <td class="description">      Reading WSDL does not work on WebLogic 10.3 since commit 835577 because<br/>
the StaxUtils.createXMLStreamReader(InputSource src) call depends on<br/>
StaxUtils.createXMLStreamReader(Source source) which uses<br/>
XMLInputFactory.createXMLStreamReader(Source source) which is a method marked as optional and it returns null in WebLogic StaX implementation<br/>
weblogic.xml.stax.XMLStreamInputFactory.
