                                            <td class="description">      Parsing AttachmentDeserializer&#39;s attachments causes an NPE in MessageImpl.getContextualProperty sometimes. This can be fixed by adding a null check in MessageImpl&#39;s getContextualProperty method.<br/>
<br/>
This problem exists in 2.2.4, it did not exist in 2.2.2. It was caused by a change in DelegatingInputStream&#39;s close behavior.
