- /var/www/html/XXXXX/package/engine.pm(788):engine::exception::getExceptionFromError<br/>
- /var/www/html/XXXXX/package/engine.pm(786):(eval)<br/>
- /var/www/html/XXXXX/cgi/rsoapserver.cgi(18):engine::end<br/>
- /opt/rsl/usr/lib/perl5/vendor_perl/5.10.0/i686-linux-thread-multi/ModPerl/RegistryCooker.pm(204):ModPerl::ROOT::ModPerl::Registry::var_www_html_XXXXX_cgi_rsoapserver_2ecgi::handler<br/>
- /opt/rsl/usr/lib/perl5/vendor_perl/5.10.0/i686-linux-thread-multi/ModPerl/RegistryCooker.pm(204):(eval)<br/>
- /opt/rsl/usr/lib/perl5/vendor_perl/5.10.0/i686-linux-thread-multi/ModPerl/RegistryCooker.pm(170):ModPerl::RegistryCooker::run<br/>
