- -e(0):(eval)<br/>
&lt;/stacktrace&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/SOAP-ENV:Fault&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/SOAP-ENV:Body&gt;<br/>
&lt;/SOAP-ENV:Envelope&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
The message contains valid xml as far a I can tell. Still the following exception is thrown:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
Caused by: com.ctc.wstx.exc.WstxParsingException: Received non-all-whitespace CHARACTERS or CDATA event in nextTag().<br/>
