                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In {{org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.client.AbstractClient.readBody(Response, HttpURLConnection, Message, Class&lt;?&gt;, Type, Annotation[])}} there is a conddition that causes {{WebClient}} not to read the content of the response if status code describes some kind of error.<br/>
<br/>
I believe that if some response is sent by the server I should be able to read it even if the status is for example 404.
