                <tr id="issuerow12441870" rel="12441870" data-issuekey="CXF-2561" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2561" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2561">CXF-2561</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                cxf-codegen-plugin throws NullPointerException when defaultOptions defined without packagenames
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Christian Schneider
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Francis De Brabandere
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Francis De Brabandere
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Nov/09 22:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Feb/10 19:02 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 08/Dec/09 18:34 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.6            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">180</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">180</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      maven
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      If the cxf-codegen-plugin is defined with this section in its configuration you will get a NullPointerException<br/>
<br/>
&lt;defaultOptions&gt;<br/>
  &lt;validateWsdl&gt;true&lt;/validateWsdl&gt; <br/>
  &lt;bindingFiles&gt;<br/>
    &lt;bindingFile&gt;${basedir}/src/jaxws/fixmsprops.xml&lt;/bindingFile&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/bindingFiles&gt;<br/>
  &lt;!--&lt;packagenames/&gt;--&gt;<br/>
&lt;/defaultOptions&gt;<br/>
<br/>
java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
	at java.util.ArrayList.addAll(ArrayList.java:472)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.maven_plugin.Option.merge(Option.java:424)<br/>
	at org.apache.cxf.maven_plugin.WSDL2JavaMojo.mergeOptions(WSDL2JavaMojo.java:260)<br/>
<br/>
A temporary fix is to add the an empty packagenames element.<br/>
<br/>
This issue can be fixed in Options.java on line 429 by putting that line inside a if(defaultOptions.namespaceExcludes != null){...}<br/>

  </td>
