                <tr id="issuerow12443282" rel="12443282" data-issuekey="CXF-2582" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2582" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2582">CXF-2582</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                wrapper InOuts not being generated per spec for single response part
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Dec/09 17:53 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 02/May/13 02:29 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 15/Dec/09 03:15 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.9,                     2.2.6            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-1243                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If a operation has schema like:<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
            &lt;element name=&quot;testInOut&quot;&gt;<br/>
                &lt;complexType&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;sequence&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;element minOccurs=&#39;0&#39; name=&#39;val&#39; type=&#39;xsd:int&#39;/&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;element name=&#39;num&#39; type=&#39;xsd:int&#39;/&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/sequence&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/complexType&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/element&gt;<br/>
            &lt;element name=&quot;testInOutResponse&quot;&gt;<br/>
                &lt;complexType&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;sequence&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;element minOccurs=&#39;0&#39; name=&#39;val&#39; type=&#39;xsd:int&#39;/&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/sequence&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/complexType&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/element&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
we are generating:<br/>
Integer testInOut(java.lang.Integer, int)<br/>
instead of:<br/>
void testInOut(Holder&lt;Integer&gt;, int)<br/>
which is what the spec calls for and what the RI generates.
  </td>
