                                            <td class="description">      I have used CXF 2.2.5 to generate java class from a complex wsdl generated from .NET environment and composed by the following files:<br/>
<br/>
ContactCenter.Services.IVR.Accettazione.svc.WSDL<br/>
ContactCenter.Services.IVR.Accettazione.svc.wsdl.wsdl0<br/>
ContactCenter.Services.IVR.Accettazione.svc.wsdl.wsdl1<br/>
