ContactCenter.Services.IVR.Accettazione.svc.xsd.xsd3<br/>
ContactCenter.Services.IVR.Accettazione.svc.xsd.xsd4<br/>
<br/>
I have used maven to perform the wsdl2java generation but i have got the following error:<br/>
<br/>
------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>
[ERROR]BUILD ERROR<br/>
------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>
java.lang.RuntimeException: Problem with WSDL: soap:header element is referring to an undefined wsdl:message element.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
