                <tr id="issuerow12444385" rel="12444385" data-issuekey="CXF-2598" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2598" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2598">CXF-2598</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Can/t set minOccurs=&quot;1&quot; with annotations
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alexey Moskvin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alexey Moskvin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Dec/09 15:33 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Feb/10 19:02 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 08/Jan/10 21:31 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.5            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.6            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Aegis Databinding            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi, I use CXF &amp; aegis binding for webservices.<br/>
For such java method: <br/>
public Calendar getSysdate()<br/>
I tried this annotations:<br/>
@org.apache.cxf.aegis.type.java5.XmlElement(nillable=false, minOccurs=&quot;1&quot;)<br/>
and<br/>
@javax.xml.bind.annotation.XmlElement(required=true)<br/>
but there is still <br/>
<br/>
&lt;xsd:complexType name=&quot;getSysdateResponse&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
&lt;xsd:element minOccurs=&quot;0&quot; name=&quot;return&quot; type=&quot;xsd:dateTime&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xsd:sequence&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xsd:complexType&gt;<br/>
<br/>
is generated WSDL file.<br/>
When we build .NET code based on this WSDL this function becomes void (because of minOccurs=&quot;0&quot;).<br/>
Is it possible to set minOccurs=&quot;1&quot;. Thanks.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
