[INFO] Final Memory: 31M/156M<br/>
[INFO] ------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
If the XSDs are located within the *same* project that is running cxf-codegen-plugin, everything works fine.  It&#39;s only when the XSDs are being referenced from the classpath that this problem occures.<br/>
<br/>
The error above originates when parsing FICR_IN110304CA.xsd, it references a schema named FICR_MT510401.xsd and within that schema (on line 105) there is an xs:group element like so:<br/>
{{&lt;xs:group ref=&quot;InfrastructureRootElements&quot;/&gt;}}<br/>
<br/>
InfrastructureRootElements is supposed to be imported via the statement on line 86 of that same schema:<br/>
{{&lt;xs:include schemaLocation=&quot;../coreschemas/infrastructureRoot.xsd&quot;/&gt;}}<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve attached a sample project which replicates the problem.  unzip the project and execute a {{mvn clean install}} within the CXFSchemaRefProblemPom directory.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ve also attached a variables view of the schema references loaded at runtime from my IDE when this error occures.  The reference to infrastructureRoot.xsd looks to be proper to me.<br/>
<br/>

