</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                JMSConduit should provide pluggable correlationMap that is persistable for example to support long-running, request-response scenarios
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
