                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Apache ServiceMix has StoreFactory/Store interfaces for managing correlation maps for many of its in-out providers. Out of the box, it provides Memory and Jdbc StoreFactory/Store implementations. The smx-jms provider currently supports the StoreFactory/Store interfaces but the smx-cxf-bc provider does not. <br/>
<br/>
In order for the smx-cxf-bc jms in-out provider to support these interfaces, the CXF JMSConduit should expose its correlationMap via an interface that can be Spring injected and adapted to by Apache ServiceMix.
