                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
We are using CXF-2.1.1 for our webservices and rest services, recently I upgraded it to 2.2.4 as there was bug 2ith 2.1.1 when you go to /services to view the list of all webservices and rest services. Upgrading to 2.2.4 seems to fix that problem, but one of our webservice has stopped working, client is passing the right object argument, but the service is getting null. I don&#39;t know what the problem is. Any help would be appreciated.
  </td>
