                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Unexpected leading and trailing white spaces in logger class name (1) can be very difficult to troubleshoot, particularly trailing ones.<br/>
<br/>
Trim the leading and trailing with spaces of the logger class name (e.g. {{org.apache.cxf.common.logging.Log4jLogger}}). <br/>
<br/>
(1) defined with the system property {{org.apache.cxf.Logger}} or in the first line of the classpath resource {{META-INF/cxf/org.apache.cxf.Logger}}
