                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I came across WS-Internationalization specification on w3c site and found its quite useful for multilingual webservices. Is there any plan that CXF is targetting to implement it in future versions. Currently our project has multilingual webservices and we have written JAXB-handler using CXF framework, which takes care of formatting data as per locale. But it adds overhead of additional parsing/modification of XML.<br/>
Can you please consider this request and let me know your thoughts.
