                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This one occured after upgrade from CXF 2.1.4 to 2.2.6<br/>
<br/>
I am calling a webservice of a 3rd party, i am getting this a stack trace. Watch out for this weird &quot;URIMappingInterceptor can only handle HTTP GET, not HTTP null&quot; line. Dont know if thats the problem. I used log4j TRACE level so that CXF Pros can see the complete story ;-)<br/>
<br/>
This problem disappears when using 2.1.4. Dont know when it started exactly, could also be 2.1.8 or 2.2.3 or something...<br/>
<br/>
