                <tr id="issuerow12447093" rel="12447093" data-issuekey="CXF-2640" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2640" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2640">CXF-2640</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WSDLToJavaContainer ignores CFG_SUPPRESS_GEN for outputdir creation
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Trivial
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Chris Dolan
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Chris Dolan
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Jan/10 22:02 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Mar/10 02:59 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/Feb/10 17:33 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      First, let me say that I realize that WSDLToJava doesn&#39;t support &quot;-suppress&quot; as a command-line option.  So this defect is quite obscure.<br/>
<br/>
Consider this code:<br/>
<br/>
		WSDLToJava w2j = new WSDLToJava(new String[] {<br/>
				&quot;-d&quot;, &quot;generatedcode&quot;, &quot;http://localhost:9090/CustomerServicePort?wsdl&quot;,<br/>
		});<br/>
		ToolContext context = new ToolContext();<br/>
		context.put(ToolConstants.CFG_SUPPRESS_GEN, true);<br/>
		w2j.run(context);<br/>
<br/>
This code works in the sense that it does not build any .java files, however it still creates the &quot;generatedcode&quot; directory.  An easy and low-risk fix would be to change WSDLToJavaContainer.validate() to wrap an &quot;if (isSuppressCodeGen()) {...}&quot; around the &quot;if(!dir.exists()) {dir.mkdirs()}&quot; block.
  </td>
