                                            <td class="description">      Even if I disabled the chunking, no content length field is added to http header.<br/>
<br/>
here the code for disable chunking<br/>
        Client client = ClientProxy.getClient(as);<br/>
        HTTPConduit http = (HTTPConduit) client.getConduit();<br/>
<br/>
