                                            <td class="description">      current [core.xsd|https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/cxf/trunk/rt/core/src/main/resources/schemas/core.xsd] doesn&#39;t have the attribute of bus , but in the [BusDefinitionParser.java|https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/cxf/trunk/rt/core/src/main/java/org/apache/cxf/bus/spring/BusDefinitionParser.java], you can see it supports setting the bus attribute.<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
