                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Under high load / burst startups with ResponseTimeFeature enabled , CXF clients and endpoints can cause {{InstanceAlreadyExistsException}}.<br/>
<br/>
{noformat:title=Sample of InstanceAlreadyExistsException}<br/>
2010/02/15 22:12:08,632  WARN [http-8080-20] org.apache.cxf.management.counters.CounterRepository - <br/>
   Can&#39;t register counter with object name org.apache.cxf:bus.id=my-bus,type=Performance.Counter.Server,service=&quot;{http://ws.example.com/}myService&quot;,port=&quot;myServiceSOAP&quot;. <br/>
   javax.management.InstanceAlreadyExistsException: org.apache.cxf:bus.id=my-bus,type=Performance.Counter.Server,service=&quot;{http://ws.example.com/}myService&quot;,port=&quot;myServiceSOAP&quot;<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
Before CXF-2675 , the message was <br/>
{noformat}<br/>
2010/02/15 22:12:08,632  WARN [http-8080-20] org.apache.cxf.management.counters.CounterRepository - Can&#39;t register counter with object name {0}. {1}<br/>
{noformat}
  </td>
