                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-2583                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      slf4j refuses to work properly if two bidings are present, but when I use cxf-rt-transports-http-jetty artifact in maven it pulls also slf4j-jdk14 (as it is transitive dependency).<br/>
<br/>
I would like this dependency to be optional, as it really is one of many jars that someone can choose to use in his own tests (I choose to use slf4j-log4j12) and such person is forced to exclude slf4j-jdk14.<br/>
<br/>
Another thing is I believe the scope should be &#39;runtime&#39; as you don&#39;t use it for main/test compilation, but only at runtime.
  </td>
