                                            <td class="environment">      windows xp sp2
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      While the WSDLQueryHandler rewrites the urls for include and import elements, it does not do so for redefines.<br/>
<br/>
Please see this thread for reference: http://fusesource.com/forums/thread.jspa?threadID=1394&amp;tstart=215<br/>
<br/>
My issue was exactly the same, except that I am seeing this via the Mule CXF Transport, which uses CXF 2.1.2.
