                <tr id="issuerow12460785" rel="12460785" data-issuekey="CXF-2745" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2745" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2745">CXF-2745</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add ability to define custom TimeToLive value for WSSecTimestamp
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Nikolay Khasanov
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Nikolay Khasanov
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Mar/10 07:57 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/May/10 18:05 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Apr/10 02:14 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.7            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.8            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently it is impossible to define any custom TimeToLive value for Timestamp generated by WS-SecurityPolicy - always default value - 300 seconds is used.<br/>
<br/>
I suggest to add one more jaxws:property like for UsernameToken, Signature, Encryption:<br/>
    &quot;ws-security.timestamp.timeToLive&quot;<br/>
and read this value in AbstractBindingBuilder when Timestamp element is creating (in protected WSSecTimestamp createTimestamp() )<br/>
if value for this property is specified - set custom timeToLive for calculating &lt;Expires/&gt; value.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310060"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312322"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312520"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312323"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312521">    7 years, 17 weeks, 6 days ago

                        </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312320"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310420">      114132
  </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312321"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312120">
</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312121"><span class="sla-agent-restricted">Restricted to agents</span>
</td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312328"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312329"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312923"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312326"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312920"></td>
