                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m trying out the Aegis databinding with CXF, and have therefore excluded the JAXB databinding jars from the classpath for my Jetty server. I get the following exception when the server beans is instantantiated. Obviously it works fine with the JAXB databinding jars on the classpath. <br/>
