                <tr id="issuerow12464309" rel="12464309" data-issuekey="CXF-2807" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2807" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2807">CXF-2807</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                UriBuilder incorrectly encoding Query Parameters value
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Fred Salles
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Fred Salles
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/May/10 23:52 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/May/10 23:59 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/May/10 23:59 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Mac OS, Tomcat
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Following code sample where a path and single parameter are encoded...<br/>
<br/>
Parameter name: &quot;param&quot;<br/>
Parameter value: &quot;foo/bar?aaa=bbb&amp;ccc=ddd&quot; (happens to be a url with query parameters)<br/>
<br/>
String test = UriBuilder.fromPath(&quot;https://dummy.com&quot;).<br/>
               queryParam(&quot;param&quot;, &quot;foo/bar?aaa=bbb&amp;ccc=ddd&quot;).<br/>
               build().toURL().toString();<br/>
<br/>
The encoded URL string returned is:<br/>
<br/>
 &quot;https://dummy.com?param=foo/bar?aaa%3Dbbb&amp;ccc%3Dddd&quot;<br/>
<br/>
Character &quot;&amp;&quot; (and &quot;?&quot;) are not encoded in the parameter value string.<br/>
The URL produced would be interpreted as follow:<br/>
<br/>
One first parameter, name=&quot;param&quot;, value = &quot;ar?aaa%3Dbbb&quot; followed by a second parameter, name=&quot;ccc%3Dddd&quot;, without value.<br/>

  </td>
