                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      GlassFish 2.x/3, CXF Version 2.2.7/8 , Ant 1.6 , jdk 1.6
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      This issue was created in the past (early 2009) and said to have been addressed as of 2.1.7 ..but i am not sure if there is anything additional that i am missing to make this work. <br/>
<br/>
BTW -&gt;I am new user to the cxf library and so i might be missing something. <br/>
This is the steps.. <br/>
1) Generate the Webservices with Contract/WSDL First approach. <br/>
2) I used the default databinding and everything works fine (i can test the wsdl and get the response correctly).<br/>
2) Then i change the configuration (cxf-servlet.xml and wsdl2java to) use xmlbeans databinding and when i publish the wsdl to the GlassFish Server, i can see the wsdl (through the browser)<br/>
3) I test the wsdl, and i get the &quot;org.apache.cxf.interceptor.Fault: UNMARSHAL_ERROR&quot;. I <br/>
<br/>
