                <tr id="issuerow12464815" rel="12464815" data-issuekey="CXF-2816" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2816" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2816">CXF-2816</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                CachedOutputStream leaves behind temp files if resetOut() is called
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Glen Mazza
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            aaron pieper
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            aaron pieper
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/May/10 17:27 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/May/10 18:03 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 20/May/10 05:16 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.8            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.9            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      CachedOutputStream&#39;s resetOut() has a section of code where it is possible to open a FileInputStream without closing it. This happens if the stream is not in memory, and copyOldContent is false.<br/>
<br/>
I noticed this when I added a &quot;LoggingOutInterceptor&quot;. When large messages were logged, temp files would accumulate in the temp directory. Applying the attached patch solved the problem.
  </td>
