                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP SP 3. Java 1.6.0_20
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The NON_UNIQUE_BODY message in tools/wsdlto/frontend/jaxws/src/main/java/org/apache/cxf/tools/wsdlto/frontend/jaxws/validator/Messages.properties misspells signature as signaure.<br/>
<br/>
Original<br/>
=================<br/>
NON_UNIQUE_BODY = Non unique body parts! In a port, operations must have unique operation signaure on the wire for successful dispatch. In port {0}, Operations \&quot;{1}\&quot; and \&quot;{2}\&quot; have the same request body block {3}<br/>
<br/>
Change<br/>
=================<br/>
NON_UNIQUE_BODY = Non unique body parts! In a port, operations must have unique operation signature on the wire for successful dispatch. In port {0}, Operations \&quot;{1}\&quot; and \&quot;{2}\&quot; have the same request body block {3}
  </td>
