                <tr id="issuerow12465090" rel="12465090" data-issuekey="CXF-2819" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2819" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2819">CXF-2819</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                &lt;protocol-bindings&gt;##SOAP12_Binding&lt;/protocol-bindings&gt; in handler chain is not correctly matched  
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Jim Ma
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jim Ma
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jim Ma
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/May/10 06:46 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Oct/10 14:52 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 21/May/10 10:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.8            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.9            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-WS Runtime            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When the service class is annotated with SOAP12 binding type :<br/>
@BindingType(value = SOAPBinding.SOAP12HTTP_BINDING)<br/>
public interface SOAPEndpoint<br/>
{<br/>
   @WebMethod<br/>
   public String echo(String msg);<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
The  handler defined with SOAP12 Binding protocol pattern can not be attached to this  endpoint, it wrongly attache the soap11 protocol binding handler :<br/>
	&lt;handler-chain&gt;<br/>
    &lt;protocol-bindings&gt;##SOAP11_HTTP&lt;/protocol-bindings&gt;<br/>
		&lt;handler&gt;<br/>
			&lt;handler-name&gt; SOAP11ClientHandler &lt;/handler-name&gt;<br/>
			&lt;handler-class&gt; org.apache.cxf.SOAP11ClientHandler &lt;/handler-class&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/handler&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/handler-chain&gt;<br/>
  <br/>
	&lt;handler-chain&gt;<br/>
    &lt;protocol-bindings&gt;##SOAP12_HTTP&lt;/protocol-bindings&gt;<br/>
		&lt;handler&gt;<br/>
			&lt;handler-name&gt; SOAP12ClientHandler &lt;/handler-name&gt;<br/>
			&lt;handler-class&gt; org.apache.cxf.SOAP12ClientHandler &lt;/handler-class&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/handler&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/handler-chain&gt;<br/>
<br/>
 <br/>

  </td>
