                <tr id="issuerow12465273" rel="12465273" data-issuekey="CXF-2823" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2823" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2823">CXF-2823</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                REST Client sending all lowercase post parameters
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jeff Peterson
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jeff Peterson
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/May/10 14:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Oct/10 14:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Jul/10 20:46 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.8            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.10,                     2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It appears that the InjectionUtils class in the fillInValuesFromBean method grabs all the getter methods from the bean being posted as form data and does a toLowerCase() on everthing after &quot;get&quot; to come up with the parameter names.  <br/>
<br/>
Example:<br/>
<br/>
public class BeanExample {<br/>
	private String fooBar = &quot;test&quot;;<br/>
	public String getFooBar() {<br/>
		return fooBar;<br/>
	}	<br/>
}<br/>
<br/>
would post:<br/>
<br/>
foobar=test<br/>
<br/>
but I&#39;d expect it to post:<br/>
<br/>
fooBar=test
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
