                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When the wsdl port is extended with an EPR, the EPR for the client should process the extension in wsdl :<br/>
&lt;port name=&quot;Test1Port&quot; binding=&quot;tns:Test1Binding&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;soap:address location=&quot;http://foo:9999/bar&quot;/&gt;<br/>
      &lt;wsa:EndpointReference<br/>
	xmlns:wsa=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing&quot;<br/>
	xmlns:wsam=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2007/05/addressing/metadata&quot;<br/>
	xmlns:tns=&quot;http://eprinwsdltestservice.org/wsdl&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;wsa:Address&gt;http://www.w3.org/2005/08/addressing/none&lt;/wsa:Address&gt;<br/>
        &lt;wsa:ReferenceParameters&gt;<br/>
           &lt;myns1:MyParam1 xmlns:myns1=&quot;http://eprinwsdltestservice.org/myns1&quot;&gt;Hello&lt;/myns1:MyParam1&gt;<br/>
           &lt;myns2:MyParam2 xmlns:myns2=&quot;http://eprinwsdltestservice.org/myns2&quot;&gt;There&lt;/myns2:MyParam2&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/wsa:ReferenceParameters&gt;<br/>
        &lt;wsa:Metadata&gt;<br/>
           &lt;wsam:ServiceName EndpointName=&quot;Test1Port&quot;&gt;tns:EPRInWsdlTestService&lt;/wsam:ServiceName&gt;<br/>
           &lt;wsam:InterfaceName&gt;tns:Test1&lt;/wsam:InterfaceName&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/wsa:Metadata&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/wsa:EndpointReference&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/port&gt;<br/>

  </td>
