                                            <td class="description">      I made a client using cxf to call a dotNet webservice.<br/>
the wsdl define a method, and this method need a parameter that defined like that: (sorry , I can&#39;t provide the whole wsdl file)<br/>
<br/>
&lt;xs:simpleType name=&quot;Children&quot;&gt;<br/>
	&lt;xs:list&gt;<br/>
		&lt;xs:simpleType&gt;<br/>
			&lt;xs:restriction base=&quot;xs:string&quot;&gt;<br/>
				&lt;xs:enumeration value=&quot;None&quot;&gt;<br/>
					&lt;xs:annotation&gt;<br/>
						&lt;xs:appinfo&gt;<br/>
							&lt;EnumerationValue xmlns=&quot;http://schemas.microsoft.com/2003/10/Serialization/&quot;&gt;0<br/>
							&lt;/EnumerationValue&gt;<br/>
						&lt;/xs:appinfo&gt;<br/>
					&lt;/xs:annotation&gt;<br/>
				&lt;/xs:enumeration&gt;<br/>
				&lt;xs:enumeration value=&quot;AAA&quot;&gt;<br/>
					&lt;xs:annotation&gt;<br/>
						&lt;xs:appinfo&gt;<br/>
							&lt;EnumerationValue xmlns=&quot;http://schemas.microsoft.com/2003/10/Serialization/&quot;&gt;1<br/>
							&lt;/EnumerationValue&gt;<br/>
						&lt;/xs:appinfo&gt;<br/>
					&lt;/xs:annotation&gt;<br/>
				&lt;/xs:enumeration&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;xs:enumeration value=&quot;BBB&quot;&gt;<br/>
					&lt;xs:annotation&gt;<br/>
						&lt;xs:appinfo&gt;<br/>
							&lt;EnumerationValue xmlns=&quot;http://schemas.microsoft.com/2003/10/Serialization/&quot;&gt;2<br/>
							&lt;/EnumerationValue&gt;<br/>
						&lt;/xs:appinfo&gt;<br/>
					&lt;/xs:annotation&gt;<br/>
				&lt;/xs:enumeration&gt;<br/>
			&lt;/xs:restriction&gt;<br/>
		&lt;/xs:simpleType&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/xs:list&gt;<br/>
&lt;/xs:simpleType&gt;<br/>
<br/>
the code in client:<br/>
Object[] params = new Object[] { new String[] { &quot;AAA&quot;, &quot;BBB&quot; } };<br/>
retParams = client.invoke(operation.getName(), params);<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
