                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      At line 180 of org.apache.cxf.jaxrs.model.URITemplate, the final group is not correctly caught. It does not assume uri template could also contains group in it. It should be change to the following statement:<br/>
<br/>
String finalGroup = m.group(m.groupCount());<br/>
<br/>
For this problem&#39;s source, refer to http://cxf.547215.n5.nabble.com/JAX-RS-request-address-extension-mapping-td1045400.html#a1045400<br/>
<br/>
The code assigning variable value at line 173 also will have problem when there are groups inside the uri template itself.<br/>
<br/>
Regards,<br/>
Rice
