                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP SP 3; Java 1.6.0_20; Maven 2.2.1
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      WS-Trust seems to require a TransportBinding security policy similar to the one fixed for raw WS-Security and mentioned in Dennis Sosnoski and commented by Dan Kulp at http://www.ibm.com/developerworks/java/library/j-jws13.html?ca=drs-.  If the attached WSTrustTest is run the WS-Trust interaction works without issue.  However if the Transport binding is commented out from EchoService.wsdl and the test re-run, the policy will not be applied.
  </td>
