                <tr id="issuerow12471760" rel="12471760" data-issuekey="CXF-2946" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2946" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2946">CXF-2946</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Unexpected namespace behavior in wsdl2java
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Incomplete
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Aug/10 23:07 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Oct/10 22:42 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Oct/10 22:42 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.9            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        NeedMoreInfo            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I run the attached wsdl through wsdl2java with the following, and all the generate code ends up in the same package, even though there are several schemata with several different namespace in the wsdl.<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
                 &lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-codegen-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;version&gt;${cxf-version}&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;executions&gt;<br/>
