                <tr id="issuerow12473133" rel="12473133" data-issuekey="CXF-2969" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-2969" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-2969">CXF-2969</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                StreamWriterContentHandler.getPrefix shouldn&#39;t return null if DEFAULT_NS_PREFIX is used
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Freeman Fang
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 02/Sep/10 12:35 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Oct/10 14:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Sep/10 00:38 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3,                     2.2.11            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      think about the message like<br/>
&lt;soap:Envelope xmlns:soap=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2003/05/soap-envelope&quot;&gt;&lt;soap:Body&gt;&lt;add xmlns=&quot;http://apache.org/cxf/calculator/types&quot;&gt;&lt;arg0&gt;1&lt;/arg0&gt;&lt;arg1&gt;2&lt;/arg1&gt;&lt;/add&gt;&lt;/soap:Body&gt;&lt;/soap:Envelope&gt;<br/>
here &quot;add&quot; element  has namespace http://apache.org/cxf/calculator/types, but use DEFAULT_NS_PREFIX &quot;&quot;, in this case getPrefix should empty string &quot;&quot; , but not null.<br/>
<br/>
Attach a testcase to expose this problem, current code will throw XMLStreamException
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
