</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                java2ws and xmlbeans databinding
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            T. Est Loadlist
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            T. Est Loadlist
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Sep/10 14:15 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Oct/10 14:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Sep/10 19:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.9            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.11            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It seems that adding:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;bean id=&#39;XmlbeansDatabindingBean&#39; class=&quot;org.apache.cxf.xmlbeans.XmlBeansDataBinding&quot; scope=&quot;prototype&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
to apache-cxf-2.2.9-src\tools\javato\ws\src\main\java\META-INF\cxf\java2wsbeans.xml<br/>
<br/>
allows java2ws  (at least in cxf-java2ws-plugin) to generate proper wsdl files (with databinding parameter set to xmlbeans).<br/>
<br/>
Are there any other issues prohibting use of xmlbeans databinding in java2ws or this omission is just oversight?<br/>
<br/>

