                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                cxf-java2ws-plugin - Generating Wrapper Bean does not produce class names based on the WebMethod annotation.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
