                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Considering the CXF User&#39;s Guide documentation:<br/>
<br/>
http://cxf.apache.org/docs/index.html<br/>
<br/>
Perhaps these tools (as present in 2.2.10 bin folder) should be include in the the tools section of the TOC of the users&#39;s guide:<br/>
<br/>
idl2wsdl — generates a WSDL document from a CORBA IDL file<br/>
wsdl2corba -corba — adds a CORBA binding to a WSDL document<br/>
wsdl2corba -idl — generates an IDL file from a WSDL document containing<br/>
a CORBA binding<br/>
<br/>
If they are in the doc already, my apologies, as I couldn&#39;t find them.
