                <tr id="issuerow12475766" rel="12475766" data-issuekey="CXF-3023" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3023" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3023">CXF-3023</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                WSDL2Java with Xmlbeans, wrong classpath
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Daniel Kulp
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Sébastien
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Sébastien
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Oct/10 14:10 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 09/Apr/13 15:15 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Mar/13 20:06 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.10            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.7.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Tooling            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">2</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        CXF-3045                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;m trying to generate Java stubs from WSDL. With JAXB the created code is working fine.  So, clients generated from WSDL files can connect to web services.<br/>
<br/>
The configuration of the JAXB generator is:<br/>
{code}<br/>
            &lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
                &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                &lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-codegen-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                &lt;version&gt;${cxf-version}&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
                &lt;executions&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;execution&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;id&gt;generate-sources&lt;/id&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;phase&gt;generate-sources&lt;/phase&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;wsdlRoot&gt;${basedir}/src/main/wsdl&lt;/wsdlRoot&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;includes&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;include&gt;*.wsdl&lt;/include&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;/includes&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;goals&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;goal&gt;wsdl2java&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/executions&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/plugin&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
When I use Xmlbeans instead of JAXB, the source generation succeed,  but once unit tests are running I got the following exception:<br/>
{code}<br/>
Caused by: java.lang.ClassNotFoundException: schemaorg_apache_xmlbeans.system.s14C5C2D1E1AB170E2BDAA0B2E05EA32B.TypeSystemHolder<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
The plugin configuration is the same (I&#39;ve also tried to remove the &lt;phase&gt; markup):<br/>
{code}<br/>
            &lt;plugin&gt;<br/>
                &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.cxf&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
                &lt;artifactId&gt;cxf-codegen-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
                &lt;version&gt;${cxf-version}&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
                &lt;executions&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;execution&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;id&gt;generate-sources&lt;/id&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;phase&gt;generate-sources&lt;/phase&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;configuration&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;defaultOptions&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;extraargs&gt;<br/>
                                    &lt;!-- look at --&gt;<br/>
                                    &lt;!-- http://cxf.apache.org/docs/wsdl-to-java.html --&gt;<br/>
                                    &lt;extraarg&gt;-db&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
                                    &lt;extraarg&gt;xmlbeans&lt;/extraarg&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;/extraargs&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;/defaultOptions&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;wsdlRoot&gt;${basedir}/src/main/wsdl&lt;/wsdlRoot&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;includes&gt;<br/>
                                &lt;include&gt;*.wsdl&lt;/include&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;/includes&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;/configuration&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;goals&gt;<br/>
                            &lt;goal&gt;wsdl2java&lt;/goal&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;/goals&gt;<br/>
                    &lt;/execution&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/executions&gt;<br/>
            &lt;/plugin&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
If there is something wrong during the generation, the generation should say something?
  </td>
