                <tr id="issuerow12475770" rel="12475770" data-issuekey="CXF-3024" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3024" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3024">CXF-3024</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Response.temporaryRedirect() cannot handle query parameter correctly
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Sergey Beryozkin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andreas Sahlbach
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andreas Sahlbach
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Oct/10 15:17 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 11/Oct/10 14:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Oct/10 17:30 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.10            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3,                     2.2.11            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        JAX-RS            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Consider the following code that wants to redirect to a non-absolute URL containing query parameters:<br/>
{code:java}<br/>
String cssLink1=&quot;http://yui.yahooapis.com/3.2.0/build/cssreset/reset-min.css&quot;<br/>
return Response.temporaryRedirect(UriBuilder.fromPath(&quot;whatever/redirection&quot;).queryParam(&quot;css1&quot;,cssLink1).build()).build();<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
The created Location header of the response will contain the following value:<br/>
{{http://myserver/app/services/public/whatever/redirection%3Fcss1=http:/yui.yahooapis.com/3.2.0/build/cssreset/reset-min.css}}<br/>
<br/>
IMHO this should be:<br/>
{{http://myserver/app/services/public/whatever/redirection?css1=http:/yui.yahooapis.com/3.2.0/build/cssreset/reset-min.css}}
  </td>
