                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Consider the Camel samples web page where each sample is clearly described with a link for further information: http://camel.apache.org/examples.html<br/>
<br/>
It would be nice a similar web page was created for CXF where all sample projects are described at a high level.  Linking to additional pages with further info per sample project, would also be good, but is outside of scope of this issue.<br/>
<br/>
Note: I created a table that was derived from the README.txt files that may serve as a starting point for such documentation.  It is attached as a MS Word document
