                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      On the main page (http://cxf.apache.org/), include related projects in the sidebar as was done on the main pages of ActiveMQ (http://activemq.apache.org/) and ServiceMix (http://servicemix.apache.org/home.html).<br/>
<br/>
I suggest the following is added to the Apache CXF main page sidebar:<br/>
<br/>
Related Projects<br/>
-- Apache ServiceMix<br/>
-- Apache ActiveMQ<br/>
-- Apache Camel<br/>
<br/>
Links are http://servicemix.apache.org/home.html, http://activemq.apache.org/, and http://camel.apache.org/ respectively.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks.
