                                            <td class="description">      Consider removal of the Users section in the CXF main page side bar as no other SOA web site (Camel, ActiveMQ and ServiceMix) has this section.<br/>
<br/>
Remove/reorganize:<br/>
<br/>
Users<br/>
-- Resources and Articles (Move to &#39;Apache CXF&#39;)  (Note: Apache CXF should be renamed to Overview, for consistency with other projects).<br/>
-- FAQ (Move to &#39;renamed&#39; Apache-CXF-&gt;Overview section)<br/>
-- Support (Move to new Community section)<br/>
-- User&#39;s Guide (Move to new Documentation section)<br/>
<br/>
Note: Overview, Documentation, Developers section needs a tremendous amount of refining... this is beyond me.<br/>

