                <tr id="issuerow12476664" rel="12476664" data-issuekey="CXF-3044" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3044" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3044">CXF-3044</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Issue with optional policy alternatives and default policy selector
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Later
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Jim Ma
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Alessio Soldano
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Oct/10 12:32 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Jan/11 18:18 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Oct/10 06:54 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        WS-* Components            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When deploying an endpoint whose wsdl contract includes a policy with just an optional alternative for enabling ws-addressing, it seems the default policy selector that&#39;s used on server side is not turning on ws-addressing when getting a message that actually uses ws-addressing.<br/>
<br/>
The wsdl is like has a policy attached to the binding as follows:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;portType name=&quot;Echo&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;operation name=&quot;echo&quot; parameterOrder=&quot;string1 testName&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;input message=&quot;tns:EchoInput&quot; wsam:Action=&quot;EchoInputAction&quot; /&gt;<br/>
      &lt;output message=&quot;tns:EchoOutput&quot; wsam:Action=&quot;EchoOutputAction&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/operation&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/portType&gt;<br/>
  &lt;binding name=&quot;EchoBinding&quot; type=&quot;tns:Echo&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
      &lt;wsam:Addressing wsp:Optional=&quot;true&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;wsp:Policy/&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/wsam:Addressing&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/wsp:Policy&gt;<br/>
    &lt;soap:binding transport=&quot;http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/http&quot; style=&quot;rpc&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;operation name=&quot;echo&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;soap:operation soapAction=&quot;&quot; /&gt;<br/>
      &lt;input&gt;<br/>
        &lt;soap:body use=&quot;literal&quot; namespace=&quot;http://Echo.org&quot; /&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/input&gt;<br/>
      &lt;output&gt;<br/>
        &lt;soap:body use=&quot;literal&quot; namespace=&quot;http://Echo.org&quot; /&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/output&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/operation&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/binding&gt;<br/>
  &lt;service name=&quot;EchoService&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;port name=&quot;EchoPort&quot; binding=&quot;tns:EchoBinding&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;soap:address location=&quot;http://foo:9999/bar&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/port&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/service&gt;
  </td>
