    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3051" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3051">CXF-3051</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Rename all POM properties that change dependency versions
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 08/Oct/10 11:24 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Apr/11 12:42 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 17/Oct/10 23:26 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.2.10,                     2.3            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Build system            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The maven gang discourages:<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;version&gt;${blah}&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
<br/>
One reason is that maven does *not* resolve these references before publishing a pom in the release process. Our released poms contain property definitions and dependencies that use them.<br/>
<br/>
If, for example, a user innocently create a setting for jetty.version that is, oh, for jetty version 8, maven will forget, entirely that we carefully declared a dependency on version 7.<br/>
<br/>
The fix we can live with is to make all of these properties have names of the form cxf-*, so that other people won&#39;t accidently set them.<br/>
<br/>

