                <tr id="issuerow12477012" rel="12477012" data-issuekey="CXF-3057" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    CXF
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="CXF-3057" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/CXF-3057">CXF-3057</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Only JAX-B sees @MTOM
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Benson Margulies
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Oct/10 13:22 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 06/Dec/10 22:48 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Nov/10 01:46 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.1,                     2.4            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Configuration            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      @MTOM is a JAX-WS annotation on the implementation bean. If it&#39;s there, MTOM should get turned on.<br/>
<br/>
However, only the JAX-B data binding ever notices it. Aegis (the only other binding I&#39;m sure supports MTOM) requires the CXF-specific mtom-enabled property on the factory (or calls on the databinding object itself) to get MTOM to turn on.<br/>

  </td>
